3,600 wide, 50 clear at top/bottom, cut 120 into the 200 wall. Cobalt pocket backs wrap the return; white lands remain 
at the original face. Keep the 1,200 × 2,400 service opening and 40-thick silver leaf; any handle cup cuts only 12 
into the leaf. | Existing `Wall_PaperWhite`, `Accent_Cobalt`, `Trim_Navy`, `Door_Leaf`. |
+| **B · Excavated Z** — one diagonal void links wall, portal composition and ceiling. | `Wall_Solid_*_Cobalt`, 
`Wall_Door_4m_PortalHead`, adjoining wall faces and underside of `Slab_*`; leaf unchanged. | Across the 12,000-wide 
